WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,580
for safety reasons

2
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:03,310
The second child was given to us last time

3
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:04,670
Installed a satellite monitoring system

4
00:00:04,870 --> 00:00:06,150
Can be taken outdoors at any time

5
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:07,670
I'll contact him right away

6
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:09,310
Ask him to adjust the monitoring and send it over

7
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:12,720
Technology is so advanced now

8
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:16,150
Why not use

9
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:17,790
if you are innocent

10
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:19,110
Call up and monitor

11
00:00:19,590 --> 00:00:23,270
Can't we prove your innocence, brother?

12
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:24,790
Please call my second brother quickly.

13
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:26,280
No need

14
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,950
There is no such thing

15
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:28,990
satellite monitoring system

16
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:34,750
They deceived me, Uncle Chen

17
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:40,570
Send Wang Ma to the police station. Brother, you are so awesome. Just a few words.

18
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:42,490
I asked my relatives to present a circle

19
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:50,530
Back from Miss Yoyo

20
00:00:50,770 --> 00:00:52,770
Miss Jiaojiao was left out in the cold

21
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:54,890
I really didn’t mean to harm Miss Youyou.

22
00:00:55,430 --> 00:01:00,140
I just want you to pay more attention to grandma

23
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:01,540
Wang Ma is not a bad person

24
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:02,900
She takes care of me every day

25
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:05,340
Make snacks for my book hair

26
00:01:06,090 --> 00:01:08,810
Grandma also sleeps with me

27
00:01:08,970 --> 00:01:10,970
Don't chase Wang Ma away, okay?

28
00:01:12,530 --> 00:01:16,880
I'm used to her taking care of me, so be nice and sweet and don't cry.

29
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:19,240
If grandma doesn’t drive her away, Tingjun

30
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:21,080
Wang Ma is an old man who stays with the family.

31
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:22,480
There is one who takes care of Jiaojiao

32
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:23,920
This happened today

33
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:25,120
She was confused for a moment

34
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:27,520
Just give her another chance, grandpa

35
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:28,920
She dared to push Jiaojiao into the water today

36
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:30,240
I will dare to do something even more outrageous tomorrow
